{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41401","headline":"送许处士坚往茅山 · 潘佑","name":"送许处士坚往茅山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天坛云似雪，玉洞水如琴。\n白云与流水，千载清人心。\n君携布囊去，路长风满林。\n一入华阳洞，千秋那可寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"潘佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}